[32m+[m[32m**Interfaces:**[m
[32m+[m[32m- `record.sh`: runs each program under `script -q -f -c "<cmd>" /data/scratch/s1/corpus/<name>.bin` inside `env TERM=xterm-256color COLUMNS=120 LINES=40` with stdin driven by a here-doc of keystrokes/`sleep`s (use `script -c` + a `(sleep; printf …) |` feeder, or `tmux -L s1 new-session -d -x 120 -y 40` + `tmux pipe-pane -o 'cat >> file'` + `tmux send-keys` — pick one, document). Programs: `vim` (open `spikes/s1/src/grid.rs`, `:set nu`, scroll `Ctrl-F` ×3, `/fn`, `:q!`), `btop` (5 s, `q`), `less` (`+G` then `g`, `/Result`, `q` on `docs/spikes/S0-results.md`), `cargo build -p s0 --color always` (touch a file first), `git -C . log --color=always -p -5`, nested `tmux -L s1b` with a split and `ls --color`, `python3 -c` progress-bar/wide-char/emoji script, and `claude` (fresh session: wait for the TUI, type `say hi`, Enter, wait 30 s, `/exit`) — if `claude` needs interaction that cannot be scripted within 2 attempts, skip it and record why. Each recording: ≥ 4 KB; write `<name>.meta.json` {cmd, cols, rows, bytes, sha256}.[m
[32m+[m[32m- `gen::adversarial() -> Vec<(String, Vec<u8>)>`: named streams — `sgr_matrix` (all SGR attrs, 16/256/truecolor), `utf8_wide_combining` (CJK, emoji ZWJ, combining marks, split-prone), `alt_screen_cycle` (primary text, 1049h, alt text, 1049l, more primary), `scroll_region` (DECSTBM + scrolling + DECSLRM), `scrollback_200` (300 lines on a 24-row terminal), `modes_mix` (1,7,25,2004,1000,1002,1006,1004,2026 on/off), `kitty_kbd` (`CSI > 1 u`, `CSI = 5;1 u`), `osc_title_pwd_hyperlink` (OSC 0, OSC 7, OSC 8 open/close, OSC 52), `tabs_and_cursor_save` (HTS, TBC, DECSC/DECRC, CUP/CUF/CUB/CUU/CUD), `erase_insert_delete` (ED, EL, ICH, DCH, IL, DL), `wrap_pending` (text exactly to column 120 then more), `dcs_apc_noise` (DCS/APC/PM strings with ST), `resize_marker` (plain text; the harness resizes at the split in a dedicated experiment). Each ≥ 1 KB, deterministic.[m
