[32m+[m[32m**Interfaces:**[m
[32m+[m[32m- `splitter::boundaries(bytes: &[u8]) -> Vec<usize>`: offsets `p` where the stream is "between complete units": not inside ESC/CSI/OSC/DCS/APC/PM/SOS sequences and not inside a UTF-8 multibyte char (state machine like `spikes/s0/src/ack.rs` + UTF-8 continuation tracking). `0` and `len` are always boundaries. `splitter::last_boundary_at_or_before(bounds: &[usize], p: usize) -> usize`.[m
[32m+[m[32m- `snap::snapshot(term: &Terminal, opts: SnapOpts) -> Vec<u8>` = `Formatter::new(term, FormatterOptions::new().with_format(Format::Vt).with_unwrap(false).with_trim(false).with_palette(o.palette).with_modes(true).with_scrolling_region(true).with_tabstops(true).with_pwd(true).with_keyboard(true).with_cursor(true).with_style(true).with_hyperlink(true).with_protection(true).with_kitty_keyboard(true).with_charsets(true)).format_alloc(None)`; `SnapOpts { palette: bool }`. `snap::restore(cols, rows, max_scrollback, snapshot: &[u8]) -> Terminal` = new Terminal + `vt_write(snapshot)`.[m
