[32m+[m[32m### Task 4: Experiment runner + report[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Files:**[m
[32m+[m[32m- Create: `spikes/s1/src/experiment.rs`, `spikes/s1/src/report.rs`; modify `main.rs` (`run` subcommand)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Test: inline (the Review Focus tests live here)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Interfaces:**[m
[32m+[m[32m- `experiment::Strategy { Naive, Aligned }`; `experiment::Case { stream: String, split: usize, strategy: Strategy }`; `experiment::run_case(bytes: &[u8], case: &Case, cols: u16, rows: u16, scrollback: u32) -> CaseResult { identical: bool, cell_mismatches: usize, state_mismatches: Vec<String>, snapshot_bytes: usize, snapshot_us: u128, restore_us: u128, first_mismatch: Option<String> }`:[m
[32m+[m[32m  - D: fresh terminal, `vt_write(bytes)`.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Naive: A ← `bytes[..p]`; S ← snapshot(A); C ← restore(S); C ← `bytes[p..]`.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Aligned: `q = last_boundary_at_or_before(p)`; A ← `bytes[..q]`; S ← snapshot(A); C ← restore(S); C ← `bytes[q..]` (tail carry).[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Compare `capture(C)` vs `capture(D)`; additionally compare **scrollback text**: `Formatter Plain` with… (check if the Formatter can include scrollback: use `with_selection` over the full history or `scroll_viewport` to top then `RenderState` rows — implement one approach and record which; if neither works, record `scrollback_compared: false`).[m
