[32m+[m[32mecho "recv is live — now CLICK the kitty window; probe in 5 s"[m
[32m+[m[32msleep 5[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# Focus probe: out-of-range marker (seq 999999). recv logs it but it never counts toward --quit-after[m
[32m+[m[32m# or the report's in-range stats (it shows up as out_of_range=1).[m
